<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\夏菜の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Uhhh..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
"Mm... Coming..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Chigaya-chan<STYLE ID="1">, may I come in?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Come in... ow-ow-ow..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Good morning, </STYLE>Chigaya-chan<STYLE ID="1">. How are you feeling?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Morning... My head's splitting..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh. You were really living it up with </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> last night. He said he's coming again tonight."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Drinking straight through New Year's is pretty rough..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The ozoni's ready. Won't you come downstairs?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... I might want some ozoni... 
{PAUSE ""}
Oh, but..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE>..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh? Don't you remember? Last night </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> made the rice porridge to close the meal together, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... 
{PAUSE ""}
What?! What do you mean?!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh heh heh, so you really don't remember. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was scolding you the whole time you made it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Because you tried to pour shochu straight into the porridge to finish it off."</STYLE> [TN: shochu: a Japanese distilled liquor]<PG>
"Mm... Now that you mention it, maybe that happened, maybe it didn't..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So you don't need to worry. I properly heard why you two </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="けんか">fought</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> seems to understand how </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> feel now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... I'm sorry for causing you trouble..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh my, it's fine. But you know, there's one thing on my mind."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... What is it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why did you think </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was the culprit?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Before, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was put under watch, and there's no evidence at all. But </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> think </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is the culprit. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Won't you tell me why?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... That's..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Of everyone in this settlement, I think the one who suspects </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> most is probably </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... 
{PAUSE ""}
Because we were told to hunt with a nata and a mace..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hunt with a nata and a mace?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> has always had me and <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> hunt with a nata and a mace. 
{PAUSE ""}
I realized it after going to Tokyo, but normally people don't hunt with things like that, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　Which means he had us use a nata and a mace for some purpose, right?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But the nata and the mace are Arata's traditional weapons, aren't they?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Even so, nobody in the settlement hunts with things like that except us. 
{PAUSE ""}
Besides, the nata and the mace are for fighting invaders. I started wondering if maybe we were being put through training to kill..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Aren't you overthinking it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Yesterday, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said she'd kill the culprit once she found out who it was..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... I thought that if <STYLE ID="5">Dad</STYLE> <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="そそのか">led</STYLE> <STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE> astray, he could get people killed just the way he wanted..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I understand what you're saying. But it's New Year's, so don't think such gloomy thoughts. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Come on, let's go downstairs. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s waiting too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... 
{PAUSE ""}
Sorry, <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE>, I'll come down in a bit. Go on ahead."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see. All right."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"A nata and a mace... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, being controlled... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Chigaya-chan<STYLE ID="1">, I wonder if she really believes that."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
